+                android:pathData="M 227.8 826.3 C 248.6 771.0 278.4 717.4 318.2 671.3 C 358.0 625.2 407.8 586.5 462.6 558.9 C 517.4 531.3 577.0 514.7 637.5 506.1 C 698.0 497.5 759.2 496.9 819.9 506.3 L 900 506.3 L 900 100 L 100 100 L 100 826.3 Z" />
